#: ../../source/reference/configuration/dev-and-validate.md:1
msgid "Configuring the two tooling commands"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/reference/configuration/dev-and-validate.md:3
msgid ""
"`freeports-dev` and `freeports-validate` are configured the same way "
"`freeports` is, and in most cases *by the same file*. This page is the "
"whole of it: what each command reads, where from, and which name a "
"setting has in each of the three places."
msgstr ""

